# Public keys that may sign the plugin registry's index.json (ed25519).
# One per line: `<id> <base64 of the 32-byte public key>`. Several keys may be
# listed so a key can be rotated: ship the new key in an app release, then
# switch the registry to sign with it, then retire the old one.
#
# A key whose id starts with `placeholder` is never trusted. The line below is
# a stand-in so the file parses; the lead replaces it with the real key (see
# docs/adr/0016-plugin-registry.md) before a release that is meant to offer
# plugins.
placeholder AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA=
